  "html": "<div _ngcontent-ng-c1416332438=\"\" inline-copy-host=\"\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_c343a36c6905a6c7\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"0\" id=\"p-rc_8fb9c8ac287c0e11-20\"><span class=\"citation-4 citation-end-4\">ANSWER: Microsoft ended standard support for Windows 10 Home and Pro on October 14, 2025. To receive subsequent security updates, Microsoft offered consumers the option to enroll in the Extended Security Updates (ESU) program via a one-time purchase, Microsoft Rewards points, or by syncing PC settings.<source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c3887773462=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3887773462=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"1\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1018145753=\"\">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1018145753=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2943621998=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2943621998=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2943621998=\"\" cdkoverlayorigin=\"\" class=\"button multiple-button ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Zobrazit podrobnosti o&nbsp;zdrojích pro citace z&nbsp;webů Microsoft. Stisknutím klávesy Enter otevřete dialogové okno se zdroji.\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" jslog=\"262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQvoAQahcKEwid3_3H3raXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQKA\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2943621998=\"\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2943621998=\"\" class=\"source-title\" style=\"max-width: 20ch;\">Microsoft</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node=\"1\">CLAIMS:\nC1: Microsoft ended standard support for Windows 10 Home and Pro on October 14, 2025. [1.1.2]\nC2: Microsoft offered consumers the option to enroll in the Extended Security Updates (ESU) program for ongoing security updates. [1.2.3]\nC3: Consumers could obtain ESU coverage through a one-time purchase, redeeming Microsoft Rewards points, or syncing PC settings. [1.2.2]</p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\">SOURCES:\n[1.1.2] Windows 10 Home and Pro - Microsoft Lifecycle – Microsoft – not stated – <response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><link-block _nghost-ng-c3558870088=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><a _ngcontent-ng-c3558870088=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" externallink=\"\" _nghost-ng-c597245961=\"\" jslog=\"197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9jMzQzYTM2YzY5MDVhNmM3IiwiY19iNTgyMDUyOWY3YjU0MWFlIixudWxsLCJyY184ZmI5YzhhYzI4N2MwZTExIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d\" href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/lifecycle/products/windows-10-home-and-pro\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahcKEwid3_3H3raXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQKQ\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/lifecycle/products/windows-10-home-and-pro</a><!----></link-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!--